// Cloudflare Pages — static site with a custom subdomain.
//
// Why Pages and not Workers static assets: the target is a *custom hostname*
// (blendee-skills.refertur.net) whose apex zone is served by Timeweb, not by
// Cloudflare. Pages has first-class custom-domain attachment and verification
// for exactly this case. Astro still builds `output: 'static'`, so no adapter
// is involved and the "Pages support removed from @astrojs/cloudflare" note
// (which applies to on-demand rendering only) does not apply here.
// See SDD/adr/0005-astro-static-cloudflare-pages-subdomain.md.
//
// Deploy:  npx wrangler pages deploy dist --project-name=blendee-skills
// DNS:     CNAME blendee-skills -> blendee-skills.pages.dev   (in the Timeweb zone)
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "blendee-skills",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "pages_build_output_dir": "./dist"
}
